  m_text: In this exciting game, the player will have to go through challenging levels,
    getting from point A to point B through various obstacles. The controls are simple
    and intuitive - just hold your finger on the screen for the character to start
    moving, and release it to stop. However, the player must be careful, as even
    one collision with an obstacle will lead to the death of the character and defeat.
    In this case, the player starts from the very beginning of the level and must
    overcome all obstacles again. With each level passed, the game's difficulty increases,
    presenting new challenges and tests for the player's skills. Will you be able
    to complete all levels and reach the final goal?
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dee5c0e5a8d518d4c997cbc935927fd1, type: 2}
